msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Their invoices have gone to %(n)s different nodes."
msgstr "其发票指向了 %(n)s 个不同的节点。"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "What to do: the sats wait in the coordinator and the buyer can submit another invoice from the app at any time. If the invoices keep going to the same destination they will most likely fail the same way: ask for an invoice from another wallet or node (with more inbound liquidity), or to wait and retry later. Each attempt lasts at most %(s)s s."
msgstr "怎么办：这些聪在协调者处等待，买方可随时在应用中提交新的发票。如果发票一直指向同一目的地，很可能会以同样方式失败：请其提供来自其他钱包或节点（入站流动性更多）的发票，或稍后再试。每次尝试最多持续 %(s)s 秒。"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "route hint via"
msgstr "路由提示经由"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "The buyer is not getting paid"
msgstr "买方收不到付款"

msgctxt "roblosats-admin"
msgid "Failed payouts: %(n)s"
msgstr "失败的付款：%(n)s"
